        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\nclassDiagram\n    direction TB\n\n    class ConsumptionRecord {\n        -record_id: int [0..1]\n        -building_id: int\n        -timestamp: str\n        -electricity_kwh: float\n        +__init__(record_id, building_id, timestamp, electricity_kwh)\n        +get_record_id(): int [0..1]\n        +set_record_id(new_id)\n        +get_building_id(): int\n        +set_building_id(new_id)\n        +get_timestamp(): str\n        +set_timestamp(new_timestamp)\n        +get_electricity_kwh(): float\n        +set_electricity_kwh(new_value)\n    }\n\n    class DatabaseManager {\n        -db_path: Path\n        +__init__(db_path: Path)\n        +get_db_path(): Path\n        +set_db_path(new_path: Path): None\n        +create_table(): None\n        +save_record(building_id: int, timestamp: str, electricity_kwh: float): int\n        +fetch_records(): list[dict]\n        +fetch_records_by_date(start_date: str, end_date: str): list[dict]\n    }\n\n    class CSVImporter {\n        +file_path: Path\n        +__init__(file_path)\n        +get_file_path()\n        +set_file_path(new_path)\n        +read_csv(): list\n        +check_columns(): bool\n    }\n\n    class DataValidator {\n        -is_valid: bool\n        +__init__()\n        +get_is_valid(): bool\n        +set_is_valid(value: bool)\n        +validate_kwh(kwh: float): bool\n        +check_missing(value): bool\n        +check_duplicate(record, records): bool\n        +check_numeric(value): bool\n        +validate_timestamp(timestamp: str): bool\n    }\n\n    CSVImporter ..&gt; ConsumptionRecord : creates\n    CSVImporter ..&gt; DataValidator : uses\n    DataValidator ..&gt; ConsumptionRecord : validates\n    DatabaseManager ..&gt; ConsumptionRecord : stores and retrieves\n\n    classDef record fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#2563EB,stroke-width:2px,color:#1E3A8A\n    classDef importer fill:#D1FAE5,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px,color:#065F46\n    classDef validator fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#92400E\n    classDef database fill:#F3E8FF,stroke:#9333EA,stroke-width:2px,color:#6B21A8\n\n    cssClass \&quot;ConsumptionRecord\&quot; record\n    cssClass \&quot;CSVImporter\&quot; importer\n    cssClass \&quot;DataValidator\&quot; validator\n    cssClass \&quot;DatabaseManager\&quot; database\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="CBfCYIjY_6jwVz2xko1D-52">
